---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="opportunities">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Society roles</span><h1>Help organize the first year.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">The listings below are unpaid roles in the student society. Internship and research source pages appear farther down.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="join">Submit membership interest</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="resources">Open the resource library</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/tool-pegboard.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A pegboard with empty pegs waiting to be filled"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>How to respond</strong><p>Use the membership form and choose the area of interest that matches the role.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Open positions</span><h2>Unpaid student-organization work.</h2></div><p>Each listing describes the work and links to the membership form.</p></div>
    <div class="filters" data-filter-group data-filter-target="#opportunity-grid"><button class="filter-button active" type="button" data-filter="all">All</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="leadership">Leadership</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="project">Projects</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="volunteer">Volunteer</button></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" id="opportunity-grid" data-opportunity-grid aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading society roles…</h3><p>Preparing the role list.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Internships and research</span><h2>Start with these source pages.</h2></div><p>These pages cover career services, campus research, and NSF-funded undergraduate research programs.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">Oberlin College</span><h3>Career Exploration and Development</h3><p>Open Oberlin’s career center page for advising, internship-search support, and application help.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.oberlin.edu/career" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open CED ↗</a></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">Oberlin College</span><h3>Undergraduate research</h3><p>Open Oberlin’s undergraduate research page for campus programs, funding, and contact information.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.oberlin.edu/undergraduate-research" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open research page ↗</a></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="resource-card__source">National Science Foundation</span><h3>Research Experiences for Undergraduates</h3><p>Search the NSF directory of REU sites, then apply through each host program.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.nsf.gov/funding/initiatives/reu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search NSF REU sites ↗</a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
